SUMMARY:Fito Páez: The World Within a Song (Netflix)
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Matías Gueilburt\n\nFrom Netflix\n\nA documentar
 y film that observes\, listens to\, and interacts with Fito Páez from a
  place of profound intimacy. The camera\, almost invisible\, witnesses h
 is every move\, accompanying him for over a year during recordings\, reh
 earsals\, tours\, and performances in major cities across Latin America\
 , Europe\, and the United States. It is also a journey through the life 
 of one of the greatest Spanish-language artists: his loves and heartbrea
 ks\, children and friendships\, excesses\, tragedies\, failures\, and su
 ccesses.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1744876
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1744876
