SUMMARY:Andy Goldsworthy in Conversation with Andrew Graham-Dixon
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Andrew Graham-Dixon\n\nFilmed entirely on-site at
  the National Galleries of Scotland during Goldsworthy's monumental 2025
  retrospective\, Andy Goldsworthy: 50 Years\, this compelling film captu
 res an exclusive\, deeply personal dialogue between the world-renowned l
 and artist and the acclaimed art historian\, author\, and broadcaster.  
 The documentary offers an unprecedented look behind the scenes of Goldsw
 orthy’s largest and most ambitious indoor exhibition. Surrounded by ne
 w installations created specifically for the show\, the pair explore the
  core environmental philosophies\, fleeting natural materials\, and crea
 tive ideas that have defined the artist's extraordinary half-century car
 eer.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1730508
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1730508
