DESCRIPTION:Directed by Irene Taylor\n\nFrom HBO Documentary Films\n\nShe
 lley Beattie\, a Deaf woman and champion bodybuilder\, found fame in the
  1990s on the hit TV show American Gladiators\, where she competed under
  the name "Siren" before her untimely death in 2008. While charismatic\,
  gorgeous\, and a fierce competitor\, Beattie also battled personal demo
 ns\, struggling with mental illness\, addiction\, and questions of her o
 wn identity. Framed by the insight of another Deaf woman in Hollywood wh
 o found herself in the spotlight at the same time\, Academy Award-winnin
 g actress Marlee Matlin\, the documentary unpacks the story of Shelley "
 Siren" Beattie and her complex legacy entwined with beauty\, mental illn
 ess\, and love.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1552433
